{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q6078756","formula":"C₁₆H₂₃ClN₂O₂","hill":"C16H23ClN2O2","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl"],"composition":{"C":16.0,"H":23.0,"N":2.0,"O":2.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Isamoltane","ru":"Исамолтан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Isamoltane (developmental code name CGP-361A) is a beta blocker (β-adrenergic receptor antagonist) with additional serotonin 5-HT1A and 5-HT1B receptor antagonist activity. It has about 5-fold higher affinity for the serotonin 5-HT1B receptor (Ki = 21 nM) over the serotonin 5-HT1A receptor (Ki = 112 nM). It has anxiolytic effects in rodents.","ru":"Исамолтан (CGP-361A) — это вещество, используемое в научных исследованиях. Оно действует как антагонист β-адренорецепторов, 5-HT1A-рецепторов, а также 5-HT1B-рецепторов. Он имеет приблизительно в 5 раз более высокую потентность по отношению к 5-HT1B-рецепторам (21 нмоль/л), чем по отношению к 5-HT1A-рецепторам (112 нмоль/л)."},"fame":7,"pubchemCid":127403,"mass":310.82,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(C)NCC(COC1=CC=CC=C1N2C=CC=C2)O.Cl","inchikey":"DCOXRJZVVPMXLY-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1-(propan-2-ylamino)-3-(2-pyrrol-1-ylphenoxy)propan-2-ol;hydrochloride","classes":[{"qid":"Q59199015","names":{"en":"group of stereoisomers","ru":"группа стереоизомеров","uk":"група стереоізомерів"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"127403","atoms":44,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":5.04,"y":-1.188,"z":-0.991,"el":"C"},{"x":3.626,"y":-0.609,"z":-1.07,"el":"C"},{"x":3.114,"y":-0.69,"z":-2.509,"el":"C"},{"x":2.771,"y":-1.351,"z":-0.136,"el":"N"},{"x":1.432,"y":-0.762,"z":0.018,"el":"C"},{"x":0.731,"y":-1.368,"z":1.252,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.716,"y":-0.879,"z":1.395,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.715,"y":0.555,"z":1.544,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.992,"y":1.003,"z":1.769,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.408,"y":1.042,"z":3.106,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.712,"y":1.408,"z":3.427,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.604,"y":1.744,"z":2.413,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.187,"y":1.734,"z":1